    {
      "name": "schema-GridState",
      "result": {
        "$defs": {
          "ColumnState": {
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "description": "One column's persisted grid state.\n\nWire form::\n\n    {\"name\": \"amount\", \"width\": 120, \"visible\": true,\n     \"frozen\": false, \"order\": 2}\n\n* ``name`` is the schema column name (verified against the live schema on\n  load; unknown columns are pruned).\n* ``width`` is in CSS pixels (null = default).\n* ``visible`` controls column visibility (default true).\n* ``frozen`` marks a frozen/pinned column (default false).\n* ``order`` is the 0-based position in the column order (null = append).",
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "maxLength": 128,
                "minLength": 1,
                "title": "Name",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "width": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "maximum": 4096,
                    "minimum": 1,
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "null"
                  }
                ],
                "default": null,
                "title": "Width"
              },
              "visible": {
                "default": true,
                "title": "Visible",
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "frozen": {
                "default": false,
                "title": "Frozen",
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "order": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "minimum": 0,
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "null"
                  }
                ],
                "default": null,
                "title": "Order"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "name"
            ],
            "title": "ColumnState",
            "type": "object"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "The full persisted grid state for one table.\n\nWire form::\n\n    {\"columns\": [...], \"sorts\": [...], \"filters\": [...],\n     \"keyword\": null, \"density\": \"comfortable\",\n     \"forcedRemote\": false, \"revision\": \"rev-3\"}\n\n* ``columns`` is the per-column layout state.\n* ``sorts`` / ``filters`` / ``keyword`` mirror the B3 query AST so the\n  grid restores the exact view the user left.\n* ``density`` is a UI hint (``compact`` / ``comfortable`` / ``cozy``).\n* ``forced_remote`` records the user's per-table remote-mode preference.\n* ``revision`` is the opaque conflict token carried on save.",
